# ---- sync with hrc_ws (2026-11-24) ----
# joint range-of-motion limits used by human_dynamics (includes ankle ranges)
!src/body_models/joint_rom/joint_ROM.json
# ISO/TS 15066 body-region table used by sensing_node
!src/hrc_body_tracking/server/iso_15066.json
# pinned Python runtime packages (SETUP.md 6.1)
!/requirements.txt
!/requirements-torch-*.txt
# chumpy import fix (SETUP.md 6.1)
!/tools/patch_chumpy.sh
# ament resource marker (empty file) required by setup.py data_files; the generic resource/ rule above would drop it
!src/hrc_body_tracking/resource/
# runtime debug output (camera pose measurements, meff query debug, ...)
/debug_log/
# editor/manual backup copies
*.bak
# Azure Kinect SDK / BT packages (Microsoft EULA, never commit; SETUP.md 2.1)
*.deb
# body models and weights (SMPL-family, PhysPT neutral.pkl, CLIFF) are never committed; see SETUP.md 7
